  "summary": "Install-time system-info beacon in @apexfdn/apex postinstall",
  "details": "install.cjs runs at npm install time and collects host and environment information using node's os module and process.env, then transmits it over https. The behavior fires automatically on default install with no documented purpose disclosed in the package, and the collected data (environment variables, platform/host identifiers) commonly contains credentials and secrets exposed to whatever destination the script contacts.",
